---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { AUTHOR, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`about · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={`about ${AUTHOR}`} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article>
				<h1>about</h1>
				<p>
					I'm HSG. I build things, break things, and occasionally figure out why.
				</p>
				<p>
					These days it's agents, Kubernetes, AI infrastructure, inference,
					observability, and the teams behind it all. I also think way too much
					about people, products, speed, GTM, building companies, and where all
					this is going.
				</p>
				<p>
					This is where I dump those thoughts. No niche. No schedule. Just stuff
					I can't stop thinking about.
				</p>
				<p>
					<em>
						Disclaimer: These are my personal thoughts and opinions. They do not
						represent those of my employer.
					</em>
				</p>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>